        "label": "OCPP dashboard",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "REQUIRES node-red-dashboard:  npm install node-red-dashboard\n需要 node-red-dashboard:  npm install node-red-dashboard\n\nOpen http://localhost:1880/ui after importing.\n导入后打开 http://localhost:1880/ui\n\nNo ui_base node here on purpose: the dashboard creates its own with a\nvalid theme the first time /ui is opened. A hand-written one ends up\nnested under theme.name and the page renders blank.\n这里刻意不放 ui_base: 首次打开 /ui 时 dashboard 会自己建一个主题合法的。\n手写的那个会被嵌套进 theme.name, 导致页面一片空白。"
    },
